# Cloudflare Workers static assets read this file from the assets directory
# (copied here from public/ by `next build`); rules are
# `<source> <destination> <status>`, and `#` lines are comments.
#
# Empty on purpose — the site's URLs are stable from the first deploy, so
# there is nothing to redirect. This file EXISTS because the deploy asserts
# it lands in the export, and a slug that moves (a page renamed, a section
# reorganised) gains its redirect here rather than silently 404ing old links.
